WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
The service can commit successfully even when its reply never reaches the caller.

2
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.000
A timeout cannot distinguish a request that never committed from a lost post-commit reply.

3
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:18.000
An ID is only a label unless the service provides a valid deduplication contract.

4
00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Use operation-specific evidence and the real retention contract before deciding to retry.
